<title>USA: Second So Madison Schs, Ind., won by Betzold Berg. [CORRECTED 20:40 GMT]</title>
<headline>Second So Madison Schs, Ind., won by Betzold Berg. [CORRECTED 20:40 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Betzold, Berg &amp; Nussbaum, Inc said it won $7.700 million of Second South Madison Community School Building Corp, Ind., first mortgage bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.555 percent (corrects from 5.550 percent).</p>
